hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"46","[AI-translation] Hamein Hajjaaj bin Minhaal ne hadees bayan ki, hamein Shu'bah ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha mujhe Abu Iyaas ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha maine Abdullah bin Mughaffal ko suna, unhon ne kaha maine Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko Fath-e-Makkah ke din dekha jab woh apni sawari par Surah Al-Fath parh rahe thay."
"47","[AI-translation] Abu Lubaaba se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha, Aisha radiyallahu anha farmati hain ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam soye nahi jab tak Az-Zumar aur Bani Israa'eel na parh lein."
"48","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Al-Khattaab ne Abu Waaqid Laythi se poocha ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam Eid-ul-Adha aur Eid-ul-Fitr mein kya parha karte thay? Unhon ne kaha: Un donon mein ""Qaaf, wal-Qur'aan-il-Majeed"" aur ""Iqtarabatis-sa'atu wanshaqqal-qamar"" parha karte thay."
